### ERP Sync Connector: ready-to-run requests
# Works in Visual Studio, JetBrains Rider and VS Code (REST Client extension).
# Start the mock ERP and the API first (see README), then send these top to bottom.
# The key below is the local demo key from appsettings.Development.json.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100
@apiKey = dev-local-key-change-me

### Health: public, no key needed
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### 1. Catalog: first page of active products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=10&isActive=true
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 2. Catalog: search by name or SKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=pump
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 3. Catalog: one product with stock per warehouse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/SKU-00001
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 4. Catalog: a customer and its open balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/customers/C0001
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 5. Orders: place an order (202 Accepted + Location)
# Change the Idempotency-Key for every new order; resending the same key returns the original order.
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales-orders
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: po-2026-1001

{
  "customerCode": "C0001",
  "customerReference": "PO-2026-1001",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "SKU-00001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "sku": "SKU-00002", "quantity": 1.5 }
  ]
}

### 6. Orders: poll the order until status is "submitted"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales-orders/{{createOrder.response.body.$.id}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 7. Orders: same key, different order → 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales-orders
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: po-2026-1001

{
  "customerCode": "C0001",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "SKU-00003", "quantity": 9 } ]
}

### 8. Orders: blocked customer and unknown product → 422 with per-field errors
# C0013 is seeded as inactive in the mock ERP.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sales-orders
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: po-2026-1002

{
  "customerCode": "C0013",
  "lines": [ { "sku": "NOT-A-SKU", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### 9. Sync: ask the worker to sync stock now
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/stock/run
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 10. Sync: recent runs (fetched / changed / skipped counts, trace ids)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/runs?take=10
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 11. Sync: how far each change feed has been read
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sync/checkpoints
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 12. Security: no key → 401 problem details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
